From: OE-Alliance <oe-alliance@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dvbaudiosink: enable native Dreambox DTS and normalize core frames

Expose DTS independently of the legacy software downmixer and convert 16LE
and 14-bit packed DTS to the 16BE input used by the Dream decoder. Preserve
buffer metadata and keep legacy software-downmix markers out of native builds.

Upstream-Status: Pending

